CHECKPOINT [2026-09-29 06:20] — state of the world after M2
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This block is a bookmark, not a decision. Everything above it is the reasoning
trail; this is what that reasoning has produced, so that a reader who has only
this file can pick the work up. The log stays append-only: later checkpoints are
appended below, never edited into this one.

WORKSTREAM
  Ingestion & Vault ("Codex #1"). PRDs in prd/ (gitignored). Branch
  feature/ingest-vault. Owned paths: tools/gen, testdata, pkg/dataplane/ingest,
  pkg/dataplane/vault, cmd/ingestd, cmd/vaultctl, configs/ingest.dev.yaml,
  scripts/send_samples.sh, docs/vault-format.md. Nothing else.

DONE
